/* Зөвхөн сургалтын жишээ — нийтэд байршуулахгүй. Зохиомол brand, бодит лого/зураг ашиглаагүй. */

/* === Токенууд === */
:root {
  --bg: #141414;
  --text: #ffffff;
  --muted: #b3b3b3;
  --red: #e50914;
  --gray: #333333;
  --radius: 6px;
  --fs-hero: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  --gap: 16px;
}

/* === Reset ба суурь === */
*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  color: var(--text);
  background: var(--bg);
}

a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

ul,
ol {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.visually-hidden {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip-path: inset(50%);
}

/* === Товч === */
.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  font: inherit;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: var(--text);
  background: var(--red);
  border: 0;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.btn--small {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
}

.btn--big {
  padding: 14px 28px;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
}

/* === Hero: градиент давхарласан дэвсгэр === */
.hero {
  min-height: 90vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background:
    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 45%, var(--bg)),
    radial-gradient(circle at 70% 30%, #5b1a6b, #1a1a4d 55%, #000000);
}

.hero__bar {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 20px 5%;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: var(--red);
}

.hero__body {
  display: flex;
  flex: 1;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 0 5% 48px;
  text-align: center;
}

.hero__title {
  max-width: 14ch;
  margin: 0;
  font-size: var(--fs-hero);
  line-height: 1.1;
}

.hero__sub {
  margin: 16px 0 0;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
}

.hero__lead {
  margin: 20px 0 12px;
}

.signup {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  width: min(100%, 640px);
}

.signup__input {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 14px 16px;
  font: inherit;
  color: var(--text);
  background: rgba(22, 22, 22, 0.7);
  border: 1px solid var(--muted);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
}

/* === Хэсгүүд === */
.section {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 10px auto;  /* 10px auto 10px auto */
  padding: 32px 5%;
}

.section--narrow {
  max-width: 800px;
}

.section h2 {
  margin: 0 0 var(--gap);
}

/* === Trending: хэвтээ гүйлгэх мөр === */
.row {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--gap);
  padding-bottom: 12px;
  overflow-x: auto;
  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
}

.poster {
  position: relative;
  flex: 0 0 160px;
  aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;
  scroll-snap-align: start;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}

.poster:hover {
  transform: scale(1.05);
}

.poster--a { background: #ee0979 }
.poster--b { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #11998e, #38ef7d); }
.poster--c { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #4776e6, #8e54e9); }
.poster--d { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #f7971e, #ffd200); }
.poster--e { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #cb2d3e, #ef473a); }

.poster__rank {
  position: absolute;
  right: 10px;
  top: 10px;
  font-size: 4rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--text);
  text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
}

/* === Нэгдэх шалтгаанууд: 4 карт === */
.reasons {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: var(--gap);
}

.reason {
  min-height: 200px;
  padding: 20px;
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1d2a5b, #2d1b4e);
  border-radius: 16px;
}

.reason h3 {
  margin: 0 0 8px;
}

.reason p {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.reason h3:hover{
  color:#11998e;
  cursor: pointer;
}

/* === FAQ: details/summary, JS-гүй === */
.faq {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  background: var(--gray);
}

.faq__q {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 20px 24px;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  list-style: none;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.faq__q::-webkit-details-marker {
  display: none;
}

.faq__q::after {
  content: "+";
  font-size: 2rem;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}

.faq[open] .faq__q::after {
  transform: rotate(45deg);
}

.faq__a {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 24px 24px;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
}

/* === Footer === */
.footer {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 32px 5% 48px;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.footer__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
  margin: 16px 0 24px;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
}

.footer__grid a:hover {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--text);
}

.footer__lang {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--muted);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
}

/* === Responsive === */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .reasons {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .reasons {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .signup {
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .footer__grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}
